slant 1\\).\n\nThe intersection of these solution sets is:\n\n\\[\n(-1, 2) \\cap (-\\infty, 1] = (-1, 1]\n\\]\n\nThus, the solution to the system of inequalities is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{(-1, 1]}\n\\]", "domain": "math", "source": "numina_math", "test_cases": null, "starter_code": null}]